{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About This Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told you the magic was low here. They lied.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Roguelike Deckbuilder With Teeth</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the Berserker - a rage-fueled warrior with 65+ unique cards that transform through multiple upgrades into devastating combinations. 65+ relics fundamentally alter how you play. No two runs feel the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Achievement Makes You Stronger</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses, discover secrets, complete feats - each achievement permanently unlocks new cards and relics for ALL future runs. The impossible boss that crushed you? Defeating it unlocks the power it used against you. The more you play, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Optional Dungeons - High Risk, Legendary Reward</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three brutal dungeons exist outside the main path. Exclusive events. Unique enemies. Rewards that exist nowhere else. The entrance fee is steep. Death is likely. But the power waiting inside turns good runs into god runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summon The Gods At Your Peril</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient altars let you call upon deities. You never know who answers. Some gods give you wings. Others clip them. The only certainty is uncertainty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch The World Transform</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through 3 acts across 9 biomes. Vibrant fantasy becomes cosmic horror. Cheerful melodies distort into oppressive soundscapes. Cute creatures give way to abominations. The atmosphere evolves with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What's In The Game</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ Berserker cards with multi-tier upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >65+ Relics and artifacts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Acts across 9 biomes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Optional dungeons with exclusive content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 Gods who answer prayers at shrines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Achievements unlocking permanent rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infinite replayability with meta-progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Development Roadmap</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COMPLETE: Berserker Class - fully playable start to finish</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLANNED: 2 Additional character classes (65+ cards each)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLANNED: Expanded late-game content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLANNED: New boss encounters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[REDACTED] - Some darkness is better left undiscovered</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Current Status: Early Access 2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Berserker experience is complete. All core systems work: deckbuilding, achievements, dungeons, god summoning, three full acts. We're polishing and expanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They said the magic was low.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They were wrong about everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868620?t=1767276613","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868620/9ef26e2051dc422901f3bb2682710f592d3e7aad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767276613","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868620/29d21c525bcd9e3d3f850f5576bf0ee56ed42a8d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767276613","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868620/29d21c525bcd9e3d3f850f5576bf0ee56ed42a8d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767276613","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse